[gd_scene load_steps=6 format=3]

; BanditStone — map two's shard: a standing stone the raiders have claimed, bound in chains with
; their standards planted either side. The veins ShardGlow draws are laid over the "Stone" node
; only, so the banners and chains keep their own colours. Built symmetric about the stone, because
; the visual is centred on its bounds. Rock: Stylized Nature MegaKit; banners, chains: Fantasy
; Props MegaKit (both CC0). About 5.2 m tall, poles included. Visual mesh_shard_banner.

